  "releaseNotes": "[2026-10-24] Fix Workspace Agent deployment and support native or DLL startup.\n        [2026-11-03] v0.2.1 Updated module behavior and related support.\n        [2026-11-03] Rename to Senparc.Xncf.WorkspaceAgent and propagate runtime files through project references for build and publish.\n        [2026-11-11] v0.2.2 read workspace text by line window and limit individual line size\n        1. Updated module behavior and related support.\n        2. Updated module behavior and related support.\n        [2026-11-12] v0.2.3 Updated module behavior and related support.\n        1. the file-system engine supports relative-path globs and content regex search.\n        2. output clearer diagnostics on operation failure while preserving the single-line size limit.\n        [2026-11-19] v0.2.4 Improved Workspace Agent runtime diagnostics and packaging\n        1. package the Agent DLL, dependency manifest, and runtime configuration into the tool directory.\n        2. copy runtime files to consumer output and publish directories through the buildTransitive target.\n        3. Kept runtime behavior and module integration aligned with the affected service and registration changes.\n        4. Standardized related English source comments and package metadata for the current release.",
